--- section 5: writer-census live-fire note (J-M18 again) ---
The census probe caught the FIRST generation of this very file:
raw byte capture of the child stdout kept Windows CRLF line
endings (newline=None translation on child pipes), landing a
mixed-EOL evidence file class=other -> DRIFT-FLAG at check
time. Root-caused and fixed by switching the generator to
text-mode capture with explicit encoding (the runner run_cmd
universal-newlines approach) -> pure LF, class=tee,
writer-census --check DRIFT-CLEAN flags=0. The completion-QC
gate did its job before commit.
